  "Title": "台中「AVI無紙化綁定自動扣繳」活動 ",
  "Content": "<p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,TRIMMED\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 標楷體;\">115</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">22</span>日起於西區「國立臺灣美術館」周邊之五權西路、五權西三街、五權西四街等<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>條路段實施智慧停車無紙化，智慧化車格內皆標繪有綠底白字「<span lang=\"EN-US\">P</span>」及「無紙化收費」字樣，不開立紙本停車繳費單，提前綁定「電子支付自動代扣繳」，還可享最高<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>折停車優惠喔。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><br /><br /></span>智慧停車無紙化<span lang=\"EN-US\">(AVI)</span>懶人包詳下方連結<span lang=\"EN-US\"><br /></span></span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 標楷體;\"><a title=\"https://tcparking.taichung.gov.tw/ParkWeb/Pages/PublicService/AviTicketQA\" href=\"https://tcparking.taichung.gov.tw/ParkWeb/Pages/PublicService/AviTicketQA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://tcparking.taichung.gov.tw/ParkWeb/Pages/PublicService/AviTicketQA</strong></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 標楷體;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體;\">停車費繳費方式詳下方連結<span lang=\"EN-US\"><br /></span></span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 標楷體;\"><a title=\"https://tcparking.taichung.gov.tw/ParkWeb/Pages/PublicService/PaymentWay\" href=\"https://tcparking.taichung.gov.tw/ParkWeb/Pages/PublicService/PaymentWay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://tcparking.taichung.gov.tw/ParkWeb/Pages/PublicService/PaymentWay</strong></a></span></p>"
